Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.00,0:00:03.00,Hook,,0,0,0,,3 PDFs. 1 file.\N{\c&H0069D2EB&}No account.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.00,0:00:08.40,Top,,0,0,0,,Your quote, price list and terms sit in three separate files, and your customer has to guess the order.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.40,0:00:12.50,Low,,0,0,0,,On your phone, open iLovePDF and pick Merge PDF.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.50,0:00:15.40,Low,,0,0,0,,Tap Select PDF files and choose all three.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.40,0:00:17.20,Top,,0,0,0,,They line up in the order you picked them.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.20,0:00:18.70,Top,,0,0,0,,Drag a file to move it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.70,0:00:20.30,Top,,0,0,0,,Tap Merge PDF.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.30,0:00:23.60,Low,,0,0,0,,A few seconds later, tap Download merged PDF.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.60,0:00:25.90,Low,,0,0,0,,One file, ready to attach.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.90,0:00:28.00,Low,,0,0,0,,We didn't sign in for any of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.00,0:00:30.40,Low,,0,0,0,,The catch: the free plan is limited.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.40,0:00:34.40,Top,,0,0,0,,Its pricing page caps a merge at 25 files and 100 megabytes,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.40,0:00:38.20,Top,,0,0,0,,and you see ads unless you pay for Premium, which is priced in US dollars.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.20,0:00:44.00,Low,,0,0,0,,Send this to the caterer who still emails three attachments with every quote.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:30.40,0:00:34.40,Lab,,0,0,0,,Free: 25 files, 100 MB per merge
Dialogue: 1,0:00:34.40,0:00:38.20,Lab,,0,0,0,,Premium removes ads. Priced in US$
